          "copies/kj388dj3308.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "crop 1, lower panel upright; pencil, one line, no number and no name. Three groups with stops between them and a stop at the end. The day is the continental 7, a top stroke and a long diagonal with a short bar across it; the month is the same diagonal without the bar, a 1. The year is a 2 with a base sweeping right and a closed narrow 0."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
